Privacy Policy – Last Stop K3N0
----------------------------------
Last Updated: November 17, 2026
----------------------------------
This Privacy Policy explains how Last Stop K3N0 (“the Bot”) collects, uses, and protects information when you use the Bot on Discord.
1. Information We Collect
When you use the Bot, we collect and store the following data:
Your Discord User ID
The number of games you have won or placed 1st in
We do not collect:
Email addresses
Payment or financial information
Real names
IP addresses
Message content (beyond what is necessary to process game commands)
Any other personal information

2. How We Use Your Information
We use the collected data only for the following purposes:
Operating the Keno game
Tracking and displaying win/placement statistics and leaderboards
Improving the Bot’s functionality and performance
Preventing abuse or unfair play

3. Data Sharing
We do not sell, rent, or share your data with third parties for marketing or any commercial purposes.
Your Discord User ID and game statistics may be visible to other users in the same Discord server through leaderboards or public bot responses, as this is part of the game’s normal function.

4. Data Retention
We retain your Discord User ID and game statistics for as long as necessary to operate the Bot and provide the service. If the Bot is discontinued or you request removal of your data, we will delete it within a reasonable time frame.

5. Data Security
We take reasonable measures to protect the limited data we store. However, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

6. Children’s Privacy
The Bot is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided data to the Bot, please contact us so we can delete it.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the “Last Updated” date at the top. Continued use of the Bot after changes are made constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.

8. Contact
If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or would like to request deletion of your data, please contact the administrators of the Last Stop Discord server.
